## Command

```shell
biome lint --suppress --only=nursery/noVueUnusedEmitDeclarations file.vue
```

## `biome.json`

```json
{
  "html": {
    "linter": { "enabled": true },
    "experimentalFullSupportEnabled": true
  }
}
```

## `file.vue`

```vue
<script>
export default {
  emits: [
    // biome-ignore lint/nursery/noVueUnusedEmitDeclarations: ignored using `--suppress`
    "unused",
    "close",
  ],
};
</script>

<template>
  <button @click="$emit('close')">Close</button>
</template>

```

# Emitted Messages

```block
Checked 1 file in <TIME>. Fixed 1 file.
```
